{"t":"Red Piece of Cloth","s":"red-piece-of-cloth-11aa5","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Red_Piece_of_Cloth_6c4007.gif","q":8,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Red Piece of Cloth</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Red Piece of Cloth\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Piece_of_Cloth_6c4007.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Products\">Creature Products</a><br/>Clothing Accessories</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">200 - 3000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">300 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.8<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060813155945&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Piece_of_Cloth_6c4007.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a red piece of cloth.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 5.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item is used mainly for Outfits and Addons. It can be obtained from <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Supply%20Package\">Gnomish Supply Packages</a>. The value of this item saw a considerable drop after the introduction of <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Oramond Minotaurs</a>), and then again when the <a href=\"#/wiki/Old%20Fortress\">Old Fortress</a> was implemented. \n<a href=\"#/wiki/Irmana\">Irmana</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>) trades a <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Robe\">Red Robe</a> for a Red Piece of Cloth.<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\nCan be obtained from <a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomish%20Supply%20Package\">Gnomish Supply Packages</a>.\nA Red Piece of Cloth can be given to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a>) in exchange for a <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Throne\">Dragon Throne</a> after handing in 12 <a href=\"#/wiki/Tome%20of%20Knowledge\">Tomes of Knowledge</a>.<br/>\n50 of these are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-outfits-quest\">Barbarian Outfits Quest</a>.<br/>\n50 of these are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/assassin-outfits-quest\">Assassin Outfits Quest</a>.<br/>\n20 of these are needed for the <b>male</b> <a href=\"#/quest/summoner-outfits-quest\">Summoner Outfits Quest</a> / <b>female</b> <a href=\"#/quest/mage-outfits-quest\">Mage Outfits Quest</a>.<br/>\n1 of these are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/what-a-foolish-quest\">Jester Outfits Quest</a>.<br/></p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Moohtant\">Animated Moohtant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Barbarian%20Bloodwalker\">Barbarian Bloodwalker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Hand\">Blood Hand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Priest\">Blood Priest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Shaper\">Broken Shaper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bullwark\">Bullwark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fear</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnfire%20Asura\">Dawnfire Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Depowered%20Minotaur\">Depowered Minotaur</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Execowtioner\">Execowtioner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Floating%20Savant\">Floating Savant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fury\">Fury</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Furyosa\">Furyosa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Bomb\">Glooth Bomb</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hellhound\">Hellhound</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hero\">Hero</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hideous%20Fungus\">Hideous Fungus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Humongous%20Fungus\">Humongous Fungus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernalist\">Infernalist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lava%20Golem\">Lava Golem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Mage\">Mad Mage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magma%20Crawler\">Magma Crawler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mawhawk\">Mawhawk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Amazon\">Minotaur Amazon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Follower\">Minotaur Cult Follower</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Cult%20Prophet\">Minotaur Cult Prophet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotau